  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "d8f818dd-afef-49a1-b64d-f602dfda5dfb",
      "title": "Leia o contexto breve e procure duas pistas em cada perfil: onde a pessoa vive e o que ela faz.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "670b6880-442b-435e-b267-08216b773346",
          "textContent": "<p>Nesta aula, você vai ler perfis bem curtos de estudantes em Barcelona.</p><p>Em cada perfil, procure duas pistas: <strong>onde a pessoa vive</strong> e <strong>o que ela faz</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "14787ba3-28aa-4c69-98e1-35cd492e485f",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase completa com tradução.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "f1932015-6c63-470b-b0e5-555f646bc852",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e leia a frase.</p><p><strong>Vive en Barcelona.</strong></p><p>Mora em Barcelona.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/89e471ee5254492f9c064ab5b8788d83_vive-en-barcelona.mp3?Expires=1794099447&Signature=PmHtsZ18WBPFW712-FWO69fjCqqmGHzWs1y94hYjqg2CO0zu7sBhcQ6k9D1nNkzjfl8nKc0DiPpw1wTwy0Crd8TWz0gSMGyC1BqRB1N7GBGDuQ0IrTQeDe0NEAPpruaz-zU6m7BFhrlwv5cfz1cOYuxuAuqhqmdjpfCKyeap7y-HRMEvSS-CfiRu4WQufsGLRWZN1CvGDIVx2NfgIF~eDMp6twaCrzCcei0TvzuA8Dgj7x5nNeF9udhJxn5Wh6oqE2adb~hYtUsARVuq1EfmlKQq7ZcUs2N-jfbpRzRxC~9oyulOlGyg4N6~1sYVFhoUIRs-ynPSS1XKe6YhNZALJw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
