    {
      "id": "22f110e5-3a71-4fa1-8363-06599ab83f74",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase completa com tradução.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e03cbe29-9176-4c48-abcb-8192dcbeb1fe",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e leia a frase.</p><p><strong>Estudia historia.</strong></p><p>Estuda história.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/916d924f30c346dd8a54752ef174734d_estudia-historia.mp3?Expires=1794099447&Signature=QU~XhCm~GznwY4Idkv1Jk5arzykvRdrAmELXb5aOm3ejT01Pf-cOjaIgrW1IQVClN4m--Jo9m7gAA0j5SP2nIHfy-pQNL6r4zH6qm6Xt7fBA99zMEJJUNlS8aEYCHfCxmEOpDF5ydciFU-29mJCBt-Fz3P87cfyAPOIMu9dCdeQhnThmyJ0oAIZpL8sRztuyUV~wo-dSdbDJYZov~oYCcaX9GW-kV92Kd94~SCxLaB9t8tE5hlcOx70tyuA-asbzrCD6XemrnUL6r04bpZYVjpy5~uuFl9DPcjoiRVoUzCgpQ4BFAID7OTGaRvPQgKMIN40i~hpEk4w1dBsuedbLMg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
