    {
      "id": "8f36ef07-f0ce-43af-a836-0ac47dd7ae10",
      "title": "Escute e leia a frase completa com tradução.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "877dd2d8-8868-4d64-9c6e-17cb90c53aa0",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e leia a frase.</p><p><strong>Trabaja en un café.</strong></p><p>Trabalha em um café.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/488f084afd2248da9eef73e0a0620fef_trabaja-en-un-cafe.mp3?Expires=1794099447&Signature=fkT1j78WeGRXhZHCl~bT939hc5CCdEllFbm4RvohVpv~jAri0peDdA0QIxXRmApvEpMR-VN4Az9qQsD62FRdZ4U-5NYGuVWeiHDETb~YrgJRJccPCU6tPfhSsBorY15bUXxRCf5N-lhsdNZQagkytRXvuZlmARXydIdyT2P-0~1t4UM6fQLtdTKeQ4A5IMIXeicQrMWI63RcjlAJBC6m2mcn2adgYXC-GaB1oFZ~WzGR7bTFoDCfbpXtmvjBXBgvA1~vmIDbUaEfDAY8o8j19OGftgHMMBeCJK6nomEx6N7JBDWIp5xnhpuW~1jaIbxSygTyy9r7DdMHfNjgx3QUCQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
